{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cesic5VxWyVX1oR5NTNpE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! The implementation is complete and all tests pass. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Implementation Summary\n\n### ✅ Core Changes\n\n**1. Order Status Tracking** (`Order.kt`)\n- Added `OrderStatus` enum with `ACTIVE` and `CANCELLED` states\n- New orders created with `ACTIVE` status\n\n**2. Cancel Endpoint** (`OrderController.kt`, `POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel`)\n- Idempotent: cancelling an already-cancelled order succeeds without change\n- All-or-nothing: if any shipment is `CONFIRMED`, returns 409 and changes nothing\n- Returns 404 if order doesn't exist\n- Cancels all `CREATED` shipments when order is successfully cancelled\n- Persists the cancelled order status\n\n**3. Error Codes** (`ApiError.kt`)\n- `ORDER_CANNOT_BE_CANCELLED`: when order has confirmed shipments\n- `ORDER_CANCELLED`: when creating shipment for cancelled order\n\n**4. Shipment Validation** (`ShipmentController.kt`)\n- Rejects shipment creation for cancelled orders with 409\n- Allows creation for non-existent orders (existing behavior preserved)\n\n### ✅ Test Coverage\nAdded 11 new tests plus updated existing tests:\n- Cancellation of active orders\n- Idempotent re-cancellation\n- Cascading cancellation of CREATED shipments\n- 409 conflict when CONFIRMED shipments exist\n- All-or-nothing validation (nothing changes on conflict)\n- 404 for non-existent orders\n- Rejection of shipments for cancelled orders\n\n### ✅ Acceptance Criteria Met\n- ✓ Existing build passes\n- ✓ All 24 tests pass (13 order + 7 shipment + 1 app + 3 customer)\n- ✓ `POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel` works as specified\n- ✓ Error responses consistent with API\n- ✓ Idempotent cancel, conflict handling, 404 handling all implemented\n- ✓ No new Maven dependencies\n- ✓ Only modified order, shipment, and api packages + tests"}],"container":nu